From 2dee48f2807bdb672d2277fd4ee4c877ec3060a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: eamwhite1 <eamwhite1@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:42:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 7.0.10: stable checks_run names; demo returns ai details

checks_run now reads proof_<name>, code_<gate> and ai_referee instead of
code:c1 / ai:task. /testnet/demo includes ai, checks_run and
criteria_results on PASS/FAIL, not only on HELD.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q1cmZ6NfauuSQwAiyzLq3w
---
 CHANGELOG.md                   |  5 +++++
 referee.py                     | 18 ++++++++++--------
 server.json                    |  2 +-
 tests/test_unified_pipeline.py | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 4 files changed, 40 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 16a7e1c..fdfbcd1 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -6,6 +6,11 @@ Protocol version header: `X-AgentTrust-Version: 0.1.0` on all responses since v2
 
 ---
 
+## [7.0.10] - 2026-11-14
+### Changed
+- `checks_run` uses stable names: `proof_nft` / `proof_domain` / `proof_vc`, `code_<gate>` (e.g. `code_exact_match`, once per gate type) and a single `ai_referee` when the AI judged the work (T2, T8, T26)
+- `/testnet/demo` returns `ai`, `checks_run` and `criteria_results` on PASS/FAIL, not only on HELD (T26)
+
 ## [7.0.9] - 2026-11-14
 ### Fixed
 - /try lock: wait (up to 20 s) for both faucet-funded test wallets to appear on a validated ledger before building the EscrowCreate. The faucet returns 200 when it submits the funding, not when it is validated, so a quick lock failed with a 502 (L1, L2)
